=================================================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: 119

[
  {
    "a": 9,
    "id": "urn:E1",
    "type": "OQ"
  },
  {
    "a": 9,
    "id": "urn:E2",
    "type": "OQ"
  }
]



05. q=a.b.c - exists: E1 and E2
===============================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: 119

[
  {
    "a": 9,
    "id": "urn:E1",
    "type": "OQ"
  },
  {
    "a": 9,
    "id": "urn:E2",
    "type": "OQ"
  }
]



06. q=!a.b.c - not exists: the three that lack it, at three depths
==================================================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: 181

[
  {
    "a": 9,
    "id": "urn:E3",
    "type": "OQ"
  },
  {
    "a": 5,
    "id": "urn:E4",
    "type": "OQ"
  },
  {
    "id": "urn:E5",
    "other": 7,
    "type": "OQ"
  }
]



--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
corDbDrop
